  "post_content": "<p>Contin&uacute;an los toros dentro de las fiestas del barrio Cam&iacute; Castell&oacute; i Adjacents de Onda. Ayer&nbsp;martes hubo dos toros por la tarde, que se embolaron por la noche, junto a una vaca de la pe&ntilde;a La Espuela. Hoy hay otro toro y el s&aacute;bado ser&aacute; el colof&oacute;n final a las fiestas taurinas. Se rif&oacute; una cerda vietnamita, que ha correspondido al n&uacute;mero 4274, y un espejo taurino, que corresponde al n&uacute;mero 883.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbousbarricastello/img_9579.jpg\" alt=\"img_9579\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbousbarricastello/img_9580.jpg\" alt=\"img_9580\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbousbarricastello/img_9581.jpg\" alt=\"img_9581\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbousbarricastello/img_9582.jpg\" alt=\"img_9582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbousbarricastello/img_9583.jpg\" alt=\"img_9583\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbousbarricastello/img_9584.jpg\" alt=\"img_9584\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbousbarricastello/img_9585.jpg\" alt=\"img_9585\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbousbarricastello/img_9586.jpg\" alt=\"img_9586\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsbousbarricastello/img_9587.jpg\" alt=\"img_9587\" style=\"max-width:10